      "id": "W4-JGEN-001",
      "severity": "P1",
      "contentKeys": [
        "java.core.generics.type-erasure-reifiable-types"
      ],
      "file": "content/java/generics/type-erasure-reifiable-types.md",
      "quote": "T[] result = (T[]) Array.newInstance(type, length);",
      "problem": "newArray의Class<T>는int.class도Class<Integer>로받는다. 이때reflection이int[]를만들지만T[]의erasure는Object[]여서helper내cast가CCE를던진다. 안전한uncheckedcast라고보이게하는예시에참조타입토큰전제가빠져있다. reflection으로소거를복원하지않는설명과String.class경로는맞다.",
      "action": "참조타입Class토큰만지원한다고명시하고primitive/void토큰거절전제를짧게보강. int.class와Integer.class차이한줄반례,기존erasure본문/정답유지.",
      "officialEvidence": [
        "https://docs.oracle.com/javase/specs/jls/se25/html/jls-15.html#jls-15.8.2",
        "https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/25/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Array.html#newInstance(java.lang.Class,int)"
      ],
      "runtimeEvidence": "제한probe Class<Integer> token=int.class는컴파일,reflection int[],newArray(token,1)는helper내CCE. String.class는String[]반환.",
      "followupIssues": [
        201
      ]
    },
    {
